  "description": {
    "en": "This third package complements the two previous : \n<a href=\"http://clic.xtec.cat/db/act_en.jsp?id=1471\">La comarca del Pla de l'Estany</a> i a \n<a href=\"http://clic.xtec.cat/db/act_en.jsp?id=3291\">Banyoles ciutat</a>. The last one specifically treats the Banyoles lake and its watering.",
